<p>The problem was chosen specifically because a single attack&ndash;defence
pipeline exercises every module of the syllabus. Module&nbsp;1 supplies the
threat model and the attack; Modules&nbsp;2&ndash;5 each supply a defence that is
implemented and measured against that attack.</p>

