<tr><td>Why suitable</td><td>Small enough to run many experiments on a 4&nbsp;GB GPU; a standard, reproducible benchmark in the gradient-leakage literature; a faithful public stand-in for private image data (e.g. medical scans) without using any real sensitive data.</td></tr>
