<h2 class="sec-break">5&nbsp;&nbsp;Initial Implementation and Demonstration</h2>
<p>The preliminary implementation is the <b>working attack</b>, run as a scripted
one-round federated-learning demonstration (<span class="mono">src/federated_demo.py</span>).
The client computes and "uploads" the gradient; the curious server recovers the
label and reconstructs the pixels. Tools: Python&nbsp;3.13, PyTorch&nbsp;2.14
(CUDA) on an NVIDIA GTX&nbsp;1650.</p>

